Subversion plugin for Lithe
Copyright 2026 Lithe contributors

This project includes the Apache-2.0 licensed Lithe Node plugin SDK and
test support from 1lck/Lithe-IDEA. Exact upstream paths, Git revision
and SHA-256 hashes are recorded in sdk.lock.json. The SDK's runtime
modules are copied into the plugin at build time; test support is never
shipped in the package.

Apache Subversion and Node.js are user-provided tools and are not
redistributed.

